<p>NASA’s Artemis II astronauts received an emotional welcome in Houston after returning from a crewed lunar flyby that took humans farther from Earth than ever before. At a public homecoming on April 11, the four astronauts spoke about how seeing Earth from deep space reshaped their sense of home. The celebration gave NASA’s Artemis program a visible success story as it works toward later lunar missions. It also shifted the focus from engineering to perspective, with the crew describing Earth itself as the most meaningful sight of the trip.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Hangar stage: After arriving at Ellington Field, the astronauts appeared on stage inside a hangar for the public welcome.</li><li>Mission-control backdrop: The ceremony unfolded at Ellington Field near NASA’s Johnson Space Center and Mission Control.</li><li>Return sequence: The crew flew in from San Diego after splashing down just offshore the previous evening, capping a nine-day mission around the Moon.</li></ul><blockquote>It&#x27;s a special thing to be on Planet Earth - Artemis II crew member</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Artemis II crew: Their remarks focused on how the view of Earth from deep space made ordinary life back home feel newly precious after the mission. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/nasas-artemis-ii-astronaut-says-earth-is-impossibly-beautiful-from-every-altitude-11345189#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>, <a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cd7jzj9rg1qo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>NASA supporters in Houston: The crowd’s reaction suggested the homecoming also recognized the wider Artemis workforce, not just the four astronauts on stage. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3349765/over-moon-artemis-ii-astronauts-make-emotional-homecoming-after-record-trip'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>CBS News: CBS framed the splashdown mainly as a mission-completion story, emphasizing that the crew had returned to Earth safely. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/041126-saturday-morning/'>CBS News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3349765/over-moon-artemis-ii-astronauts-make-emotional-homecoming-after-record-trip'>Over the moon: Artemis II astronauts make emotional homecoming after record trip</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/041126-saturday-morning/'>04/11: Saturday Morning</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cd7jzj9rg1qo'>&#x27;It&#x27;s a special thing to be on Planet Earth&#x27;: Artemis crew welcomed home in Houston</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/nasas-artemis-ii-astronaut-says-earth-is-impossibly-beautiful-from-every-altitude-11345189#publisher=newsstand'>NASA&#x27;s Artemis II Astronaut Says Earth Is &quot;Impossibly Beautiful&quot; From Every Altitude</a> - ndtv.com</li></ul>